      "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\n`/health` and `/health_generate` submit a one-token generation request (rid `HEALTH_CHECK_<uuid>`), and the tokenizer traces it like any user request: root span, tokenizer and scheduler spans. With tracing on, every probe of every server adds a full trace, burying user requests in trace search and sampling.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n`init_trace_ctx` gives `HEALTH_CHECK_*` rids a null trace context, in both sync and async tracing, so health checks create no spans. `request_metrics_exporter` already skips these rids for the same reason (they are not user requests).\r\n\r\nDocs: a note in `production_request_trace.mdx`.\r\n\r\n### Behavior changes\r\n\r\nHealth check requests are no longer traced.\r\n\r\n## Accuracy Tests\r\n\r\nNot applicable: tracing only, no change to model outputs.\r\n\r\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\r\n\r\nNot benchmarked. A health check now skips trace setup entirely.\r\n\r\n## Tests\r\n\r\n- `test_req_time_stats.py::TestInitTraceCtx::test_health_checks_are_not_traced`: a `HEALTH_CHECK_*` rid gets a null context, and a normal rid still gets a trace context.\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\r\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\r\n- [x] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\r\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed). (Not applicable: no model-output change.)\r\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\r\n\r\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\r\n---\r\n### CI States\r\n\r\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39634934181](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39634934181)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\r\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39634934080](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39634934080)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\r\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39634934107](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39634934107)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\r\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
