      "filename": "docs/docs/references/production_request_trace.mdx",
      "patch": "@@ -7,6 +7,8 @@ SGLang exports request trace data based on the OpenTelemetry Collector. You can\n \n You can find example screenshots of the visualization in https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/8965.\n \n+Health check requests (`/health`, `/health_generate`) are not traced.\n+\n ## Setup Guide\n This section explains how to configure the request tracing and export the trace data.\n 1. Install the required packages and tools",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/raw/8ccf507121675b88279b692765894df9a53e3c61/docs%2Fdocs%2Freferences%2Fproduction_request_trace.mdx",
